            name: "create-hosted-configuration-version",
            description: Some("Creates a new configuration in the AppConfig hosted configuration store. If you're creating a feature flag, we recommend you familiarize yourself with the JSON schema for feature flag data. For more information, see Type reference for AWS.AppConfig.FeatureFlags in the AppConfig User Guide"),
